  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide Core Support to the Global Facility for Disaster Reduction and Recovery (GFDRR)To ensure that Communities at risk from natural disasters in GFDRR&apos;s 31 priority countries benefit from implementation of comprehensive disaster risk reduction programmes integrated into national strategiesProvide core support to the Global Facility for Disaster Reduction and Recovery to provide technical and financial assistance to developing countries to build their capacities to manage disaster risks, and to recover and reconstruct when a crisis hits.</narrative>
  </description>
